y the harness or gateway, not by the model, and do not depend on the run's final answer.\",\n  \"coverage_required\": true,\n  \"verify\": \"1) Find who writes records. 2) Answer no if the model writes them via a tool, records are built from the final answer, or logging runs only if the run completes.\",\n  \"candidate_sites\": []\n}\n{\n  \"repo\": \"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-batch-5bhm2c6_/agent\",\n  \"patterns_file\": \"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-batch-5bhm2c6_/skill/prescan/patterns.yaml\",\n  \"files_scanned\": 36,\n  \"note\": \"Hits are places to read, not findings. Answer each hit's ask before citing it.\",\n  \"capped\": [],\n  \"hits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H001\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P27\",\n      \"item\": \"B11\",\n      \"title\": \"securityContext to check for missing hardening\",\n      \"file\": \"k8s/deployment.yaml\",\n      \"line\": 67,\n      \"text\": \"securityContext:\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does this securityContext set allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, runAsNonRoot: true, readOnlyRootFilesystem: true, and drop ALL capabilities? A missing field defaults to the permissive value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H002\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P27\",\n      \"item\": \"B11\",\n      \"title\": \"securityContext to check for missing hardening\",\n      \"file\": \"k8s/deployment.yaml\",\n      \"line\": 86,\n      \"text\": \"securityContext:\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does this securityContext set allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, runAsNonRoot: true, readOnlyRootFilesystem: true, and drop ALL capabilities? A missing field defaults to the permissive value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H003\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P27\",\n      \"item\": \"B11\",\n      \"title\": \"securityContext to check for missing hardening\",\n      \"file\": \"k8s/deployment.yaml\",\n      \"line\": 135,\n      \"text\": \"securityContext:\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does this securityContext set allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, runAsNonRoot: true, readOnlyRootFilesystem: true, and drop ALL capabilities? A missing field defaults to the permissive value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H004\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P27\",\n      \"item\": \"B11\",\n      \"title\": \"securityContext to check for missing hardening\",\n      \"file\": \"k8s/deployment.yaml\",\n      \"line\": 152,\n      \"text\": \"securityContext:\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does this securityContext set allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, runAsNonRoot: true, readOnlyRootFilesystem: true, and drop ALL capabilities? A missing field defaults to the permissive value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H005\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P31\",\n      \"item\": \"B02\",\n      \"title\": \"Wildcard IAM or RBAC grant\",\n      \"file\": \"infra/terraform/github.tf\",\n      \"line\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"Resource = \\\"*\\\"\",\n      \"ask\": \"Is this grant attached to the agent's identity? A wildcard action or resource gives it operations beyond the named ones the task needs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H006\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P40\",\n      \"item\": \"R13\",\n      \"title\": \"Audit write inside a try block\",\n      \"file\": \"src/agent/loop.ts\",\n      \"line\": 37,\n      \"text\": \"\",\n      \"ask\": \"Is the audit record written only after the action succeeds? Check the deny, error, and exception branches also record the attempt, and that an audit failure doesn't silently pass.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H007\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P40\",\n      \"item\": \"R13\",\n      \"title\": \"Audit write inside a try block\",\n      \"file\": \"src/agent/loop.ts\",\n      \"line\": 38,\n      \"text\": \"try {\",\n      \"ask\": \"Is the audit record written only after the action succeeds? Check the deny, error, and exception branches also record the attempt, and that an audit failure doesn't silently pass.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H008\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P40\",\n      \"item