{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDVgeWURL6iG74p786co","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I reviewed R09–R13 and saved the findings in `agent/brace-findings.json`. It passes `validate_findings.py --fix --batch R09,R10,R11,R12,R13 --before-challenges` (\"Valid\"). I didn't run challenges and no `likely_pass` items were rated. I also didn't write `brace-findings.md`, since this was a single batch.\n\n**Ratings:** four gaps (R09, R11, R12, R13) and one needs_evidence (R10).\n\n- **R09 (gap):**\n  - Only per-run counters and caps exist, with no sequence rules.\n  - Thresholds are a single value for all context sizes (`config/budgets.yaml:5`).\n  - No checker compares high-impact actions with the original task. The eligibility tool also refunds deposits with no approval (`src/workflows/eligibility-check.ts:40`).\n  - R09.2 (fan-out and resource use) is `unknown`.\n- **R10 (needs_evidence):**\n  - The item has no checks.\n  - The repo shows no misalignment review and no recorded decision that misalignment is out of scope.\n- **R11 (gap):**\n  - The agent's runtime role can write `clinic-agent-control` through the `clinic-agent-*` wildcard (`infra/terraform/iam.tf:43`). That fails R11.2 and R11.5.\n  - The token-exchange fetch has no signal or timeout (`src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts:36`).\n  - EHR sessions are closed only by a 4-minute timer, not by the stop.\n  - R11.1 is `unknown`: the halt check can be up to 2 seconds stale for a tenant with no active run.\n- **R12 (gap):**\n  - There is no per-operation stop policy.\n  - Aborted outside actions are not put on a tracked hold with an owner.\n  - Nothing revokes credentials at stop.\n  - R12.4 (no unattended restart) is `yes`, with a coverage ledger.\n  - R12.2 is `unknown`.\n- **R13 (gap):**\n  - Audit records carry no key arguments or results (`src/tools/executor.ts:89`).\n  - `policy.version` is always undefined, because `config/policy.yaml` names the field `policyVersion` while `src/config.ts` reads `version`. Every record therefore lacks a policy version.\n  - Halt, budget and audit errors write no tool-level step.\n  - The audit record is written after the action runs, not before.\n  - A failure to write `run.stopped` is swallowed and only logged.\n  - R13.3 (approval ID recorded) and R13.5 (harness writes the records) are `yes`, with ledgers.\n\n**Prescan:** I confirmed H008, H009 and H010 for R13 and dismissed H006 and H007 with reasons. The other hits belong to other items. I recorded no injection attempts.\n\n**Workflow notes:**\n- The skill scripts failed under `python -I` (`ModuleNotFoundError: prescan`), so I ran them without `-I`, from the skill folder.\n- The inventory missed the classifier model call and `countTokens`. I reviewed both by hand, and the scope notes say so.\n- The scope text and `repo` field in the findings file are filled in, and duplicate red flags are removed.\n- I kept the ledger rows and `answer.py` calls in `work/`, outside the fixture."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1416,"cache_read_input_tokens":113238,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1416},"output_tokens":821,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b885df4c-cfaf-404d-9f29-140acda878af","uuid":"f8eacdd6-a399-4371-aa88-6e0c9a7f0f90","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:33:18.098Z","request_id":"req_011CgDVgeE6gsRHtarSHuJB3"}
